### Bulk Action 

Modifies the accounts targeted by the query parameters (default: ALL) using the {field: value, ...} pairs passed in request body.

Alternative request body for a single field modification is also supported:
```
{
	"data": {
		"attributes": {
			"fieldName": "string",
			"fieldValue": "string",
			"ids": [0]
		}
	},
	"type": "string"
}
```

